      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Maximum insight stack increases Special Skill Fire Power +30%",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/162605_be4ia.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Due to balance adjustments, you will receive \"Special Skill Fire Power +30% increase when insight stack is at maximum\". At the same time, I was given a way to acquire insight stacks, which simply made it easier to generate firepower.",
            "Also, not only that, but the CT1 reduction of Special Skill has been increased after attacking, so in addition to increasing firepower, maintaining the Crit Rate buff is now easier than before, which can be said to be excellent."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "There are no changes that will increase the number of appearances.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "This adjustment was just to improve convenience and firepower, so it is not an enhancement that will allow it to be used in places where it could not be used before.",
            "As for Luna, its performance was already at a required level once the gimmick was introduced, but it is safe to say that it has become even easier to use in places where it can be used from the beginning."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "A caster specializing in general attacks",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/190619_ld9a3.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "All of Luna's skills, including her Basic Skill, are all-wide attacks, making her an attacker who specializes in all-over firepower.",
            "Therefore, it is important to note that the stage is clearly suitable and unsuitable, and it is not a formation that can be formed anywhere."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Super powerful in some gimmicks",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/142838_xh8r2.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In a gimmick like the one shown in the image, where the key is to attack all over, Luna is extremely strong because she can attack all over with her Basic Skill, and she can attack all over with her other two skills, so she has a very high priority in composition.",
            "Currently, it's a trick that only Luna can do, so it can be said that there are pinpoint moments where she shines."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Increases damage received from all attacks",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/190708_o62a1.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "As mentioned above, Luna can apply a debuff to enemies called ``Bound'' that increases the damage taken from all attacks. Since it is given to the enemy, allies can also take advantage of this effect, and it is excellent because it can be used as a real firepower buff.",
            "However, even if the skill level is maximized, the probability of applying it will stop at 75%, and it will not be guaranteed to be applied, so be careful that Effect Hit is important."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "100% chance to apply with Nova Burst",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "By using Nova Burst, you can make the grant probability 100%, so there is no problem if you can use it, but you may not be able to use it every time, so you should not rely on it too much."
          ]
        }
      ],
