      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Excellent as a Star Attribute supporter",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/195611_s8c3r.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Frey has the effect of increasing the amount of recovery for Star Attribute allies, so it is recommended to employ him as a supporter of a Star Attribute party.",
            "It may be a little thin and hard to see, but Star Attribute allies recover 20,367, but other attributes recover only 16,153.",
            "A simple calculation shows that Star Attribute can provide about 1.26 times the amount of recovery compared to other attributes."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Special Skills are also the same.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Special Skill also increases the recovery amount of Star Attribute, but when I tried this, the recovery amount increased from 28553 to 33273, about 1.16 times as much.",
            "Although there is not a dramatic change, this is a single recovery and the amount of recovery is quite large, so the difference is also large, so it is still excellent."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "The full recovery of the jumping stack is just a bonus.",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/200815_3m9r5.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "The amount of total recovery when the jump stack is at its maximum is poor, resulting in a recovery amount of about 5,000 for a HP of about 110,000.",
            "If you think about it after maximizing your jumping stack, it honestly doesn't have a strong effect, so it's best to consider it as a bonus."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "CT short debuff release",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/183133_gnqbp.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Frey can remove debuffs with CT3's Special Skill, but being able to remove all debuffs is powerful.",
            "It's a little difficult to use since it's just a single ally, but the amount of recovery it provides is perfect, and it can be a powerful support when it comes to making a single attacker active."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Provides a barrier throughout",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/183102_2ikxu.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "The Ultimate Skill is full recovery and full barrier, which has an excellent effect on durability.",
            "In particular, it is valuable to give a barrier to all allies, and it is also useful as a gimmick countermeasure against some enemies, so it can be said to be excellent that it supports both barrier and recovery."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Adds a single barrier with Nova Burst",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In addition to the Ultimate Skill, the Basic Skill Nova Burst can also provide a barrier. This is the \"single ally with the current lowest HP\", so be careful as you cannot choose the target.",
            "The balance adjustment has increased the duration to 2T, so it's nice to see more situations where it's useful for protecting your allies."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "There are situations where the Effect RES buff is also useful.",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/200312_7ojt1.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Being able to give the Effect RES buff to everyone can be said to be an excellent bonus effect.",
            "There are only a limited number of situations where this effect can be used, but Star Savior's enemies often have debuffs, so there are likely to be many situations where it would be useful."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Be careful when used with some characters such as Amora.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Amora has effects such as giving herself an insight stack when she receives a debuff, so be careful if you use Effect RES to bounce it off, as it may actually have the opposite effect."
          ]
        }
      ],
