      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Changed to have multiple total recovery",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/203500_icoe4.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "The Special Skill, which originally recovers a single ally with a low HP percentage, has changed to full recovery.",
            "Since the recovery of a single target with a low HP ratio remains the same, the amount of recovery against three other simple targets has increased."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Increased recovery amount for Sun Attribute",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/204114_3jxmr.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Ultimate Skill has a specification that increases the amount of recovery compared to Sun Attribute, and as you can see in the image, the amount of recovery increases from 14836 to 18810.",
            "Although the magnification itself is modest at about 1.26x by simple calculation, there is still a difference of 4000, so if you increase the skill level, the difference will become even bigger.",
            "However, the only increase in Sun Attribute is this Ultimate Skill, and since that Ultimate Skill is heavy at CT5, it is questionable whether it can be used as a Sun Supporter.",
            "It would be best to recognize this as just a bonus effect."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Possesses valuable skill damage immunity",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/125745_o0uch.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In addition to durability support through HP recovery, Serpang can also grant skill damage immunity to himself and one ally. It's a shame that you can't choose the target, but being able to reduce enemy damage to 0 is extremely powerful.",
            "Please note that you can only negate enemy attacks, so you cannot negate debuff damage such as combustion, so be careful."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Supporter who can apply debuffs",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/203743_tmxw4.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Various debuffs can be applied, such as Serpang, combustion, and attack debuffs, but characters that can apply debuffs as supporters are valuable.",
            "Especially recently, the number of debuffs applied can affect the enemy's gimmicks, so if you think about it, there may be a role that only Serpang can play in the future."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Check out his compatibility with Christel",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In addition to inflicting multiple burns, Christel can also extend the duration of burns by turns, making it compatible with Serpang, which can inflict burns.",
            "Furthermore, Christel is a Sun Attribute and can also receive Serpang's recovery amount increasing effect, so there may be situations where they can be used in combination in the future.",
            "Click here for details on Christel's performance"
          ]
        }
      ],
