    "summary": "Characters who fight using a combination of unique buffs and enhanced Basic Skills · Obtain Snow Flower when using Ultimate Skill and ally's non-attack skills. · While in possession of Snowy Flowers, use Special Skill to suddenly obtain the Law of the Law\n└Action Gauge can also be increased, which takes a lot of work. · Basic Skill is strengthened when you suddenly possess the Ritsuryo Code, and you can hit Basic Skill repeatedly with burst included. · It is troublesome that it eats up the burst\n└Recovery performance and other characters' firepower decrease accordingly",
