      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Repel debuffs with immunity",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/165058_571ih.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Special Skill gives you a special buff called immunity, and you can also counter weakening effects such as attack debuffs and effects such as Action Gauge reduction.",
            "You can't use it to remove reinforcements, so you can't rely on it anytime and anywhere, but it's great because it allows you to fight stably regardless of debuffs."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Self-healing possible",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/165022_d1e7a.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Basic Skill Nova Burst allows you to recover HP equal to 30% of the damage dealt. As the damage increases, the amount of recovery increases, so it can be said to be an excellent effect that is very easy to use.",
            "Since you can cover a certain amount of damage yourself, you can use the supporter's recovery to other sources, making your durability more stable."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Self-buff is low",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/164933_s03pt.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Although there are excellent buffs such as long-lasting speed buffs, the only buffs that directly affect firepower are Unique Passive's ATK Up and Damage Dealt buffs, so your own buffs alone will not give you enough firepower.",
            "Use Moon Attribute characters that can provide firepower support, such as Emily and Lu, and devise a composition that can cover the firepower buff."
          ]
        }
      ],
