      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Improved convenience with balance adjustment",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/174917_ajzsw.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Lacy's balance adjustments focus on convenience rather than firepower, and she can now use turbulent stacks to inflict entangling dreams on enemies.",
            "This is a nice enhancement for Lacy, whose performance is greatly affected by the presence or absence of intertwined dreams, but please note that the activation condition is only when you are hit by a bullet, and the effect is only applied to the attacker, so be aware that there is a possibility that it will be absorbed by your cronies."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "No need to worry about overlapping",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "This effect only activates against enemies that have not been given Intertwined Dreams, so there is no need to worry about, for example, immediately after applying it with the Ultimate Skill, the turbulent stack effect will be activated and give Intertwined Dreams, rendering the turbulent stack effect almost meaningless.",
            "However, on the other hand, the dreams that are once intertwined will need to be interrupted, so we will need to take measures to ensure durability in that case."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Recovers own HP when attacked by intertwined dream state enemies",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/134203_617bu.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "When Lacy uses her special move, she has a chance of inflicting \"Intertwined Dreams\", which reduces the attack power of the affected enemies by 10%.",
            "Due to the passive effect, if you are attacked by an enemy that has been given Intertwined Dreams, you will recover according to your own attack power, so your self-resistance is extremely high.",
            "Although he is an attacker, he can also be on the vanguard, so he can be said to be a versatile character who can demonstrate his strength no matter who he is teamed up with."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Recovery amount is ATK 54%",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Lacy's recovery amount is ``54% of her current attack power'', which means she recovers more than half of her attack power, so it can be said that her attack power is great."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Abundant self-buffs that can increase attack power and damage",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/174227_9vy2m.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "When Lacy uses her special move, she increases her attack power for 2 turns, and her special skill increases the damage dealt by 20% if the target is in a dream state where they are intertwined.",
            "Due to the abundance of self-buffs, it is possible to maintain high firepower even without the buff effects of other characters.",
            "Also, since Lacy's self-recovery is dependent on attack power, using Ultimate Skill will increase the amount of recovery and increase her survivability."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Use skills in the order of ultimate → special",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Lacy is a character that is supposed to give you intertwined dreams, so first use your Ultimate Skill to give your enemies intertwined dreams.",
            "If you can grant Intertwined Dreams, you can activate recovery even if you receive damage from an enemy, and the damage of Special Skills will increase against enemies in Intertwined Dreams, allowing you to fully utilize Lacy's strengths in both offense and defense."
          ]
        }
      ],
