      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Almost unconditional Crit Rate 50%",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/143811_08le4.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Unique Passive has an almost unconditional Crit Rate buff of \"Crit Rate 50% when attacking\", and it is very powerful because it makes it easy to get a critical hit.",
            "Roberta's ability to secure 50% on her own is excellent, as the presence or absence of critical hits affects the CT shortening of Special Skills."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "It is also great that it is easy to choose carefully.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "You can earn 50% Crit Rate by yourself without doing anything, so it's quite easy to carefully select equipment.",
            "By allocating the Crit Rate to Crit DMG and attack power, you can produce high firepower, so be sure to choose carefully so that the Crit Rate does not overflow."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Increased Action Gauge increases the number of steps",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/143909_hvi4b.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Roberta has Action Gauge increase in all skills, and it takes a lot of moves. The basic skill Nova Burst is 20%, the special skill is 30%, and the ultimate skill is 30-50%, which is powerful.",
            "Also, since the Special Skill has a short CT, it can be used frequently depending on the enemy's overall attack, and you can aim for immediate action after the attack, making it a very strong attacker if you get into it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Active as a meta for Lacy and others in Gauntlet",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/154754_bz14l.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Characters with powerful gauntlets such as Lacy and Emily often have full-scale attacks, and Roberta is also powerful as a counter to them.",
            "Emily has an attribute advantage, and against Lacy and Dana's general attacks with debuffs, debuffs can be removed by removing debuffs, and the compatibility is quite good, so it is recommended to use it as a countermeasure against the above characters."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Weak against characters that do not have a general attack",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Of course, you will have to fight against an enemy that does not have an all-out attack with one skill lost, which will inevitably make it difficult.",
            "If you can check the enemy's skills before fighting, be sure to check them carefully before forming your team."
          ]
        }
      ],
