      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "I want to focus on the travel arcana as well.",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/151053_chdi9.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Since there is a high degree of dependence on Crit Rate, be sure to place emphasis on Arcana that increases Crit Rate during your journey.",
            "Since the effect overlaps with the critical buff during battle, it will be possible to activate Unique Passive more stably."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Excellent continuous damage due to bleeding",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Special Skill and Ultimate Skill can inflict \"bleeding\" on enemies and cause continuous damage.",
            "Bleeding has higher damage than \"burning\", which is one of the other types of continuous damage, and can function as a sufficient source of damage if it can be applied consistently.",
            "It will be blocked by opponents with high Effect RES, so it would be a good idea to increase Effect Hit to some extent to make it easier to bleed."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Slip damage penetrates the barrier",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Slip damage such as bleeding can penetrate the barrier and directly damage the enemy, so it is easy to damage some bosses and defenders in PvP.",
            "There is also absolute resistance, and it cannot be granted with certainty, so you should not be overconfident, but if you can increase the slip damage firepower as much as possible, you will be able to have a more advantageous battle."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Strong in long-term battles",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In addition to Unique Passive, which increases your own attack power each time you attack, you also have a Special Skill whose effect increases depending on the number of stacks of Jump, and the longer the battle lasts, the more firepower you get.",
            "Cosmo Gate, which has many long-term battles, will probably be more useful than Gauntlet, which has many short-term decisive battles.",
            "However, if you take advantage of the Action Gauge increase effect when a critical hit occurs, you will be able to use your maximum power at an early stage without having to be consciously aware of it, so you can perform well even in the gauntlet without any problems."
          ]
        }
      ],
