        "exactDescription": "Releases sword energy from the air and slashes and attacks all enemies.\nIf you are in Seifu (unremovable) state, give 3 Jump stacks to Star Attribute allies.\nIf you are not in Seifu (cannot be removed) state, cause ATK Up and Meigetsu (cannot be removed) for 3 turns.\nAfter using Phantom Kenbu on your turn, if Seifu Meigetsu is available, an additional turn will occur.",
