      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Activate special skills with high firepower frequently",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/135249_s19w2.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Amora's Special Skill has a base multiplier of 100% attack, which is set quite high compared to other characters.",
            "In addition to this firepower, it comes with increased Action Gauge and decreased accuracy, so it's safe to say that the performance of the skill itself is top-notch.",
            "Furthermore, if you have the unique buff \"Night Blooming Flower\", it will reduce CT1 after using Special Skill, so it is super powerful that you can use this skill in CT2 at the earliest.",
            "The basic strategy is to maintain your own unique buffs with Passive and Ultimate Skills, and use these skills to take turns and deal damage."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "PvE performance is top class",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/182214_hbck5.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "As mentioned above, in addition to the special skills with high firepower, there are many roles that can be completed by one person, such as dealing with surrounding people with general attacks and contributing to durability with hit rate debuffs, so it can be said that it has top-class performance in PvE.",
            "In content such as operations, the fact that there are few enemies with debuffs that cannot be removed is a tailwind, and the fact that there are currently no parts that feel difficult to use is very powerful.",
            "Although this may change depending on the future composition of the enemy, there is no doubt that its performance is extremely powerful at this point."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Take advantage of performance from the start",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/140404_afz4e.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "As Amora fights, I first want to give myself the unique buff \"Flower that Blooms at Night,\" so there is no problem using Ultimate Skill on the 1st turn.",
            "Since the Ultimate Skill comes with an additional turn, you can shorten the CT while using a special skill with high firepower on the 1st turn, so it can be said to be quite easy to use as a starting strategy."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Powerful even in PvP",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In PvP, especially strategy battles, it is important to be able to reduce the opponent's HP in the first move, so Amora can be said to be a very powerful attacker who can unleash maximum firepower from the first move.",
            "Reducing the hit rate is also a powerful effect if you consider it as a support for the durability of other characters, so you can expect it to be useful in PvP as well."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Unremovable debuffs are a problem",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/141131_wtn5c.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Amora's strength is that she can remove debuffs on her own, which is why the increased damage she deals when she is not weakened is powerful, but be careful as you cannot remove debuffs that cannot be removed.",
            "If you are given a debuff that cannot be removed, the damage deal will no longer increase and your firepower will drop suddenly, but the good news is that this does not cause any problems with the operation itself.",
            "I hope that in future character implementation, there will be characters who can give buffs that can deal with debuffs that cannot be removed."
          ]
        }
      ],
