      "strengthsSections": [
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Action Gauge increase amount is too large",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/152457_jeqmt.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Professor M has Action Gauge increase in all skills from Passive to Ultimate Skill (Basic Skill is burst), and the amount of Action Gauge increase is high.",
            "Since the Action Gauge increases when an ally attacks, the more moves your allies take, the more your own moves will increase, so you will basically be fighting with your overall firepower by taking advantage of your moves."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Feels like a semi-supporter",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/153310_9mxjv.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Professor M can use Basic Skill to flank the ally with the highest attack power. Pincer Dual-Attack is fixed by activating Basic Skill, so basically you can just trigger the Basic Skill of the ally with the highest attack power.",
            "Being able to trigger this attacker's Basic Skill is powerful and requires a lot of moves, so its strength is that it can frequently inflict the main attacker's firepower + its own firepower on the enemy.",
            "Therefore, what is important is the performance of the attacker rather than the player himself, so it is important to ensure that the attacker is properly trained."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Compatibility with Amora is too good",
          "imageUrl": "https://appmedia.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/160902_gscp1.webp",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Currently, it is powerful in combination with Amora, and being able to receive Amora's firepower on Professor M's turn is extremely powerful.",
            "In addition to that, Amora also has her own turn, so the overall firepower is extremely high.",
            "Professor M is happy that Amora herself has a lot of work to do, so it can be said that the combination is beneficial for both parties.",
            "Click here for details on Amora's performance"
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h4",
          "title": "Own firepower is not that high",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Since his own performance is based on ally's skill trigger and Action Gauge increase, the only firepower buff is the Ultimate Skill damage increase debuff, so his firepower is modest.",
            "It's a bit heavy for Professor M to be the main attacker, so it's a character for people who have a certain amount of skills."
          ]
        },
        {
          "level": "h3",
          "title": "Depends on the attacker and can easily keep up with the environment",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "paragraphs": [
            "As mentioned above, one of the company's strengths is that it is in a semi-supportive position, so it can easily keep up with future changes in the environment.",
            "If a powerful main attacker appears, you can simply combine it with that character, so the great point is that you can use it regardless of your own performance."
          ]
        }
      ],
